<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-SCOTLAND BEAT ITALY 29-22.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-SCOTLAND BEAT ITALY 29-22.</headline>
<dateline>EDINBURGH 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scotland beat Italy 29-22</p>
<p>(halftime 8-12) in their international at Murrayfield on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Scotland - Tries: Tony Stanger, Kenny Logan (2), Derek</p>
<p>Stark. Conversions: Craig Chalmers (3). Penalty: Rowen Shepherd.</p>
<p>Italy - Penalty try. Conversion: Diego Dominguez. Penalties:</p>
<p>Dominguez (4). Drop goal: Dominguez.</p>
</text>
